# S2.1-A: official Sun modality ZIP, its extracted members, and any
# S2.1-B derived artifacts MUST NOT enter Git history.
#
# Background:
# - The official `Decision_Logic_data.zip` is licensed under
#   `unknown_pending_confirmation` per docs/research/SUN_MODALITY_DATASET_INGESTION.md.
# - User authorization on 2026-07-15 explicitly forbids re-distribution,
#   uploading, or committing the raw archive and its unpacked members.
# - Even the S2.1-B "extracted copy" target `_extract/` is a development-only
#   provenance; only the immutable hashes belong in Git (see
#   data/development/sun_modality/source_manifest.json).
#
# This directory-level ignore keeps the entire raw/ subtree out of Git while
# still allowing the `.gitignore` file itself to be committed so the
# policy travels with the directory.

*
!.gitignore
